    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "https://www.auctioneera.ie/property/88-rosepark-balrothery-dublin-k32-rr60\r\nImportant note: Details of upcoming viewings and latest offers are available at the Auctioneera website link above.\r\n\r\nAuctioneera is delighted to present 88 Rosepark, Balrothery.\r\n\r\nNestled in the charming village of Balrothery, this is an attractive end-of-terrace residence, exuding a modern allure. The property boasts a beautifully maintained exterior, with a neatly manicured front lawn and a comfortable driveway offering ample parking space. Its architectural style is contemporary with fine masonry, resonating with traditional Irish elements that blend seamlessly into the tranquil neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, one is greeted by the inviting warmth of the sitting room, where a woodburning stove serves as a captivating focal point, perfect for cosy evenings. The ground floor opens further into a generous, well-lit dining area equipped with dual aspect windows, allowing for abundant natural light. Adjoining the dining area, the charming kitchen is configured with modern cabinetry and appliances, making it an ideal space for culinary endeavours.\r\n\r\nThe upper floor boasts three spacious bedrooms. The master suite is a sanctuary of comfort, complete with an ensuite bathroom for added convenience. Additionally, the two remaining bedrooms feature built-in wardrobes, optimising space with clever design. The presence of three further bathrooms ensures functional utility for family living or hosting guests.\r\n\r\nExternally, a private rear garden provides a serene outdoor retreat, perfect for leisure activities or entertaining, enhanced by a practical patio area suited for al fresco dining.\r\n\r\nSituated within walking distance of local amenities, the property benefits from proximity to schools, sports clubs, and convenient transport links, including bus stops and access to key road networks, making commuting notably convenient.\r\n\r\nThis home is ideal for first-time buyers or those looking to scale up into a functional family home with character. With its combination of modern features and traditional warmth, 88 Rosepark merges practicality with charm, offering a welcoming haven in the heart of Dublin."
      },
